      "instance_name": "frustration",
      "label": "frustrated emotion",
      "description": "The person is bent over with physical effort, shoveling snow, which conveys a sense of laborious struggle and annoyance. The overlaid text 'i hate snow' explicitly states the emotion of frustration toward the task and the weather condition.",
