      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "person shoveling snow",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals who experience or are familiar with the physical labor of snow removal, particularly homeowners or property owners in snowy regions. The meme's humor relies on the shared cultural understanding of snow as a burdensome winter task, making it relatable to those who have to shovel snow regularly. The audience is likely to include people living in areas with heavy snowfall, who can identify with the frustration expressed in the text 'i hate snow' and the absurdity of framing snow as an 'invasion' on their land.",
